it=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="A close-up of a customer sitting on a sofa, holding their phone and smiling at their screen." width="1000" height="665" class="landing-feature-banner__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-54256dfc></div><div class="landing-feature-banner__content--standard landing-feature-banner__content" data-v-54256dfc><!----><!----><h2 class="landing-feature-banner__title" data-v-54256dfc>Download the Courier Community App for the easiest way to apply</h2><div class="landing-feature-banner__rich-text landing-feature-banner__rich-text--standard landing-feature-banner__rich-text--padding" data-v-54256dfc><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Begin your application today and become part of our team of over 25,000 active couriers. Once you&#39;re on board, you can use the platform to connect with fellow couriers, sharing news, ideas, and experiences, and contributing to a vibrant community eager to welcome you.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!----><div class="landing-feature-banner__app-store" data-v-54256dfc><!--[--><a href="https://apps.apple.com/gb/app/hermes-courier-community/id1568298035" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank" class="landing-feature-banner__app-store-button" aria-label="Download on the App Store" data-v-54256dfc><!--[--><img src="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/1ed957a3-786e-4aec-8062-fbfc9623ef48_app-store-white.svg?q=50&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=max" srcset="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/1ed957a3-786e-4aec-8062-fbfc9623ef48_app-store-white.svg?q=50&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/1ed957a3-786e-4aec-8062-fbfc9623ef48_app-store-white.svg?q=50&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/1ed957a3-786e-4aec-8062-fbfc9623ef48_app-store-white.svg?q=50&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="Download on the App Store" width="140" height="42" class="landing-feature-banner__app-store-logo" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-54256dfc><!--]--></a><a href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.hermescourier.app" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank" class="landing-feature-banner__app-store-button" aria-label="Get it on Google Play" data-v-54256dfc><!--[--><img src="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/d119a56a-6383-4e8e-90ef-9a13f7255f7f_google-play-white.svg?q=50&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=max" srcset="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/d119a56a-6383-4e8e-90ef-9a13f7255f7f_google-play-white.svg?q=50&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/d119a56a-6383-4e8e-90ef-9a13f7255f7f_google-play-white.svg?q=50&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/d119a56a-6383-4e8e-90ef-9a13f7255f7f_google-play-white.svg?q=50&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="Get it on Google Play" width="140" height="42" class="landing-feature-banner__app-store-logo" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-54256dfc><!--]--></a><!--]--></div></div></div></section><section id="our-people-promises-to-our-couriers" class="landing-feature-banner landing-feature-banner--neutral" data-slice-type="landing_feature_banner" data-slice-variation="fullWidthBanner" data-v-54256dfc><div class="landing-feature-banner__container" data-v-54256dfc><div class="landing-feature-banner__image-container" data-v-54256dfc><!--v-if--></div><div class="landing-feature-banner__content--neutral landing-feature-banner__content" data-v-54256dfc><!----><!----><h2 class="landing-feature-banner__title" data-v-54256dfc>Our people promises to our couriers</h2><div class="landing-feature-banner__rich-text landing-feature-banner__rich-text--neutral" data-v-54256dfc><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Work in a way that suits you<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->We&#39;ll help fit your work schedule around personal commitments. Discover your ultimate work-life balance and turn your busy schedule into a well-oiled machine. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Make a positive difference in your community<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Provide a reliable, accurate and efficient service that our millions of customers depend on. You&#39;ll be an ambassador for the Evri brand – and our clients’ brands – in your local community. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->You’re in control<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Once you’re onboarded, we’ll trust you to do the work in your own time, using your own equipment. You’ll be running your own business, and we’ll work with you to build it.  <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Be a part of something bigger<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Connect to fellow couriers over the Courier Community App. This will keep you up to date with relevant information and give you access to training, resources and connections to colleagues at Evri head office, allowing you to carry out your deliveries every day stress-free. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!----><!----></div></div></section><section id="sign-up-today-and-get-started-as-a-courier-in-liverpool" class="landing-feature-banner landing-feature-banner--standard" data-slice-type="landing_feature_banner" data-slice-variation="fullWidthBanner" data-v-54256dfc><div class="landing-feature-banner__container" data-v-54256dfc><div class="landing-feature-banner__image-container--image-right landing-feature-banner__image-container" data-v-54256dfc><!--v-if--></div><div class="landing-feature-banner__content--image-right landing-feature-banner__content--standard landing-feature-banner__content" data-v-54256dfc><!----><!----><h2 class="landing-feature-banner__title" data-v-54256dfc>Sign up today and get started as a courier in Liverpool</h2><div class="landing-feature-banner__rich-text landing-feature-banner__rich-text--standard landing-feature-banner__rich-text--padding" data-v-54256dfc><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->There’s something for everyone as an Evri courier, so whether you’re looking for a simple side hustle or a full-time gig, we’ve got you covered. It’s quick and easy to apply to work and develop a career in this growing industry. All you need is: <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><ul><!--[--><!--[--><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->A full, clean driving licence <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->You must be over 18 <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Access to a vehicle <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->The right to work in the UK <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->No unspent criminal convictions <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><!--]--><!--]--></ul><!--]--></div><div class="landing-feature-banner__button-wrapper" data-v-54256dfc><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-primary e-button--variant-3 e-button--icon-right e-button--link landing-feature-banner__button landing-feature-banner__button--standard" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="https://courier-app.hermescloud.co.uk/auth/index-old" data-v-54256dfc style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><!----><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[--> Get started as a courier<!--]--></span></a><!----></div><!----></div></div></section><section id="frequently-asked-questions" class="faqs" index="9" data-v-6bee4b86><div class="faqs-content" data-v-6bee4b86><h2 class="faqs-title" data-v-6bee4b86>Frequently asked questions</h2><!--[--><div class="e-accordion-row" data-test-id="imhavingproblemssubmittingmyapplicationwhatshouldido-accordion" data-v-6bee4b86 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-imhavingproblemssubmittingmyapplicationwhatshouldido" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-imhavingproblemssubmittingmyapplicationwhatshouldido" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-gtm-track="div-I’m having problems submitting my application. What should I do?-open answer" data-test-id="imhavingproblemssubmittingmyapplicationwhatshouldido-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="imhavingproblemssubmittingmyapplicationwhatshouldido-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>I’m having problems submitting my application. What should I do?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-imhavingproblemssubmittingmyapplicationwhatshouldido" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-imhavingproblemssubmittingmyapplicationwhatshouldido" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="imhavingproblemssubmittingmyapplicationwhatshouldido-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><div class="faqs__cms-rich-text" data-v-6bee4b86><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->First, try switching to a different browser (like Chrome, Safari, or Edge) or use your mobile device. If the issue continues, please email <!--]--><!--]--><a href="mailto:courier.recruitment@evri.com" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->courier.recruitment@evri.com<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> and our team will be happy to help. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row" data-test-id="whataretheworkinghoursfortherole-accordion" data-v-6bee4b86 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-whataretheworkinghoursfortherole" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-whataretheworkinghoursfortherole" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-gtm-track="div-What are the working hours for the role?-open answer" data-test-id="whataretheworkinghoursfortherole-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="whataretheworkinghoursfortherole-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>What are the working hours for the role?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-whataretheworkinghoursfortherole" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-whataretheworkinghoursfortherole" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="whataretheworkinghoursfortherole-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><div class="faqs__cms-rich-text" data-v-6bee4b86><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->As a self-employed courier working hours can be flexible depending on factors such as your availability, the location of your round, and the number of parcels that particular round generates. On average a courier works approximately 5-6 hours a day. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row" data-test-id="howwillibepaid-accordion" data-v-6bee4b86 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-howwillibepaid" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-howwillibepaid" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-gtm-track="div-How will I be paid?-open answer" data-test-id="howwillibepaid-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="howwillibepaid-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>How will I be paid?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-howwillibepaid" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-howwillibepaid" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="howwillibepaid-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><div class="faqs__cms-rich-text" data-v-6bee4b86><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Couriers are paid on a monthly basis via BACS. All payments made by Evri to the courier will be without deductions of things like income tax for which you are responsible. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Invoices are accessible through the dedicated link in the Courier Community App. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row" data-test-id="doineedadditionalinsurance-accordion" data-v-6bee4b86 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-doineedadditionalinsurance" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-doineedadditionalinsurance" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-gtm-track="div-Do I need additional insurance?-open answer" data-test-id="doineedadditionalinsurance-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="doineedadditionalinsurance-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>Do I need additional insurance?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-doineedadditionalinsurance" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-doineedadditionalinsurance" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="doineedadditionalinsurance-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><div class="faqs__cms-rich-text" data-v-6bee4b86><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->As a self-employed courier you must have the correct level of 3rd party cover whilst you’re out making deliveries. Evri has developed a ‘top-up’ insurance with Marsh Insurance. Charged at £1.35 per day and only on the days that service is provided to Evri, this gives the 3rd party cover required for Self Employed Couriers whilst making deliveries and collections on behalf of Evri and our clients. (full details can be provided upon request). <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row" data-test-id="cantfindyourquestionhere-accordion" data-v-6bee4b86 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-cantfindyourquestionhere" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-cantfindyourquestionhere" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-gtm-track="div-Can&#39;t find your question here?-open answer" data-test-id="cantfindyourquestionhere-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="cantfindyourquestionhere-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>Can&#39;t find your question here?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-cantfindyourquestionhere" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-cantfindyourquestionhere" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="cantfindyourquestionhere-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><div class="faqs__cms-rich-text" data-v-6bee4b86><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><a href="/become-a-courier-faq" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Check out our dedicated courier FAQ directory<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><